    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "b1e4364e-d04f-44f7-8c54-b2d4a02bd8cc",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "It&apos;s all about sending a message...",
        "Location": "LOCATION_WET_RAT",
        "PublicId": "130097030593",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 5c04a005-b2fe-428a-b49a-0afca1729b25).Image",
        "Description": "You must enter the labratory, get in, kill the targets and get out within 20 minutes before the alarm goes off and the building goes into complex lockdown. Once that 20 minutes is up, you will be stuck in there. The guards are more heavily armed the deeper into the laboratory you go and more surveillance cameras. You cannot be seen by anyone or any surveillance. The employer wants you to send a message and blow up the target and her body guard. Time is off the essence. Good luck Agent Buntain.",
